    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d70">

                <pb facs="0454" n="240" xml:id="pg240"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 57.</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Hurlbut to Mr. Fish</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 58.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-08-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 27, 1871</date>. (Received October
                    14.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to inclose a copy of my
                    dispatch to Señor Zapata on the affair of the Montijo. His reply was forwarded
                    by last mail.</p>
                <p>I believe that, in the hurry of doing up the last mail, I neglected to number my
                    last dispatches. They are numbered on my records 56 and 57.</p>
                <p>Your, obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. A. HURLBUT.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d70-a1.xml" xpointer="d70-a1"/>
            </div>
